<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Facture d'abonnement {{ invoice.invoiceNumber ?: invoice.id }}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif;
            color: #152033;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.45;
            margin: 0;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .page {
            padding: 18px 24px 22px;
        }

        .page-logo {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .page-logo img {
            display: block;
            width: 118px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .header-shell {
            background: #eef1f5;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .header-table,
        .two-cols,
        .meta-table,
        .summary-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .header-table td,
        .two-cols td {
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .brand-lockup {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .brand-eyebrow {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: #647089;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .brand-name {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f295f;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .brand-meta,
        .muted {
            color: #687487;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .invoice-box {
            width: 220px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .invoice-kicker {
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: #647089;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .invoice-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #16233c;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .invoice-number {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .status-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 6px;
            padding: 4px 9px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #d8e6ff;
            color: #163b83;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #647089;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .card {
            border: 1px solid #dde3eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .card strong {
            color: #16233c;
        }

        .two-cols td:first-child {
            padding-right: 6px;
        }

        .two-cols td:last-child {
            padding-left: 6px;
        }

        .meta-table td {
            padding: 4px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ebeff5;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .meta-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: 0;
        }

        .meta-table td:last-child {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #16233c;
        }

        .summary-wrap {
            border: 1px solid #d9e0ea;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .summary-table th,
        .summary-table td {
            padding: 8px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e7ecf3;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .summary-table thead th {
            background: #f5f7fa;
            color: #556178;
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .summary-table th:last-child,
        .summary-table td:last-child {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .summary-table tfoot td {
            background: #f7f9fc;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #16233c;
            border-bottom: 0;
        }

        .summary-table .line-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #16233c;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .summary-table .line-subtitle {
            color: #6c778c;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .facturx-note {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 8px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #f2f5f9;
            color: #56627a;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #6b768b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        {% set account = prestataire ? prestataire.account : null %}
        {% set invoiceNumber = invoice.invoiceNumber ?: ('ABO-' ~ (invoice.id ?: 'draft')) %}
        {% set totalAmount = invoice.totalAmount ?: invoice.amountPaid ?: '0.00' %}
        {% set subtotalAmount = invoice.subtotalAmount ?: totalAmount %}
        {% if platform.logo_data_uri %}
            <div class="page-logo">
                <img src="{{ platform.logo_data_uri }}" alt="TrouveMoi">
            </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="header-shell">
            <table class="header-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <div class="brand-eyebrow">Facturation plateforme</div>
                        <div class="brand-name">{{ platform.legal_name }}</div>
                        <div class="brand-meta">{{ platform.address_line_1 }}, {{ platform.postal_code }} {{ platform.city }}, {{ platform.country }}</div>
                        <div class="brand-meta">RCS Paris {{ platform.rcs }} · TVA {{ platform.vat_number }}</div>
                        <div class="brand-meta">{{ platform.email }} · {{ platform.phone }}</div>
                    </td>
                    <td class="invoice-box">
                        <div class="invoice-kicker">Facture d'abonnement</div>
                        <div class="invoice-title">Abonnement</div>
                        <div class="invoice-number">{{ invoiceNumber }}</div>
                        <div class="muted">
                            {{ invoice.paidAt ? 'Payée le ' ~ invoice.paidAt|date('d/m/Y') : 'Émise le ' ~ invoice.createdAt|date('d/m/Y') }}
                        </div>
                        {% if invoice.dueAt %}
                            <div class="muted">Échéance le {{ invoice.dueAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <span class="status-pill">{{ invoice.status.label }}</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <table class="two-cols section">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <div class="section-title">Émetteur</div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <strong>{{ platform.legal_name }}</strong><br>
                        {{ platform.address_line_1 }}<br>
                        {{ platform.postal_code }} {{ platform.city }}<br>
                        {{ platform.country }}<br>
                        RCS Paris {{ platform.rcs }}<br>
                        TVA : {{ platform.vat_number }}<br>
                        <span class="muted">{{ platform.email }}</span>
                    </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                    <div class="section-title">Facturé à</div>
                    <div class="card">
                        <strong>{{ prestataire.companyName ?: prestataire.legalName ?: 'Prestataire' }}</strong><br>
                        {% if prestataire.legalName and prestataire.legalName != prestataire.companyName %}
                            {{ prestataire.legalName }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.address %}
                            {{ prestataire.address }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.addressComplement %}
                            {{ prestataire.addressComplement }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.postalCode or prestataire.city %}
                            {{ prestataire.postalCode }} {{ prestataire.city }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.country %}
                            {{ prestataire.country }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.siret %}
                            SIRET : {{ prestataire.siret }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if prestataire.vatNumber %}
                            TVA : {{ prestataire.vatNumber }}<br>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if account and account.email %}
                            <span class="muted">{{ account.email }}</span>
                        {% elseif customer and customer.billingEmail %}
                            <span class="muted">{{ customer.billingEmail }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Références</div>
            <div class="card">
                <table class="meta-table">
                    <tr>
                        <td>Plan</td>
                        <td>{{ subscription and subscription.plan ? subscription.plan.name : 'Abonnement plateforme' }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Périodicité</td>
                        <td>{{ subscription ? subscription.billingPeriod.label : 'Non disponible' }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% if invoice.periodStart and invoice.periodEnd %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>Période facturée</td>
                            <td>Du {{ invoice.periodStart|date('d/m/Y') }} au {{ invoice.periodEnd|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if invoice.stripeInvoiceId %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>Référence Stripe</td>
                            <td>{{ invoice.stripeInvoiceId }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Détail facturé</div>
            <div class="summary-wrap">
                <table class="summary-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Description</th>
                            <th>Montant</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <div class="line-title">{{ subscription and subscription.plan ? subscription.plan.name : 'Abonnement TrouveMoi' }}</div>
                                <div class="line-subtitle">
                                    {{ subscription ? subscription.billingPeriod.label : 'Périodicité non disponible' }}
                                    {% if invoice.periodStart and invoice.periodEnd %}
                                        · période du {{ invoice.periodStart|date('d/m/Y') }} au {{ invoice.periodEnd|date('d/m/Y') }}
                                    {% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </td>
                            <td>{{ subtotalAmount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currencyCode }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% if invoice.taxAmount and invoice.taxAmount != '0.00' %}
                            <tr>
                                <td>TVA</td>
                                <td>{{ invoice.taxAmount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currencyCode }}</td>
                            </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                    </tbody>
                    <tfoot>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Total TTC</td>
                            <td>{{ totalAmount|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currencyCode }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tfoot>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="facturx-note">
            Ce PDF est généré par TrouveMoi et embarque un fichier XML de préparation Factur-X pour faciliter l’exploitation documentaire. Stripe reste utilisé pour le paiement et la synchronisation des montants.
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div>Document émis par {{ platform.legal_name }} pour la facturation de l’accès à la plateforme.</div>
            <div>La transmission réglementaire officielle n’est pas assurée par ce téléchargement seul.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
